before:
Complete local C example; the app itself does not execute it:
```c
#include <stdio.h>

struct Point { int x; int y; };
int main(void) {
 struct Point a = {.x = 2, .y = 5};
 struct Point b = a;
 struct Point *p = &b;
 p->x = 9;
 printf("%d %d\n", a.x, b.x);
}
```

